WEBVTT

00:13:28.863 --> 00:13:31.727
može nas odvesti do novog shvaćanja

00:13:31.727 --> 00:13:33.390
svemira

00:13:33.390 --> 00:13:36.409
ili nas može dovesti u slijepu ulicu.

00:13:36.899 --> 00:13:38.973
No, kako god bilo,

00:13:38.973 --> 00:13:42.155
u jedno sam siguran:

00:13:42.445 --> 00:13:45.514
putovanje će biti puno iznenađenja.

00:13:45.514 --> 00:13:46.677
Hvala vam!

00:13:46.677 --> 00:13:52.135
(Pljesak)